Saruyama-sensei?

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:49.390
You girls!

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.850
Ba
kuon<i>!!</i>

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.900
Ba
kuon<i>!!</i>

