00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:22.050
I didn't realize it was just a shallow beach...

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:24.090
Girls, huddle.

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:26.600
But since I came this far,
Don't you think this is a chance?

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:27.510
A chance?
But since I came this far,

