None of the teachers wanted to.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:39.570
Even if Saruyama-sensei is just riding a 50cc bike.

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:43.570
If we can console her broken heart,

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:46.450
