Tonight, we'll do our best to
comfort you, Saruyama-sensei.

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:04.550
All those guys who
dumped you were terrible.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:05.760
For real!

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:08.550
Even though you're so cute, Sensei.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.680
We all love you!

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:13.730
Guys are so selfish.

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:16.770
Did you know? They say the engine displacement

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.570
