00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.250
Ah, I see!

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:44.550
Hey hey, what does she
mean by "man's thing"?

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:49.050
I-Idiot! It's the size of their hearts, obviously.

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.300
Is that so?

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.850
