00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:20.210
I'm impressed by you Sensei.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:24.250
We all want to ride together with you.

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:32.260
Thank you, Hane-chan.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:34.640
I'm so stupid,

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:37.310
