00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:51.570
Here, join me, Hane-chan.

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:52.870
Whoa, hang on!

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:55.080
I'm kidding, I'm kidding.

00:14:55.080 --> 00:15:02.000
Obviously, a professional educator
would never force a minor to drink.

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:05.420
Something about the smell...

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:08.720
it's making it kinda dizzy...

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:12.050
I'm getting... kinda...

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.430
Oh, dear. Hane-chan fell asleep.

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:19.100
Hane was pretty tired.

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:22.650
Then how about we check and see

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:25.900
how many wrinkles she lost on her butt

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:27.440
from the long ride...

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:30.030
S-Sensei! What are you doing?!

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:32.870
Looking at each other's buttocks
should be reserved for close friends only!

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:33.950
What?

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.580
It's you guys' fault for being so cute!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.160
Being cute is a crime!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:39.830
It's not my fault!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:44.540
Maybe this is the reason
why 13 guys all broke up with you.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:47.710
When she starts drinking
she starts liking girls.

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:50.380
I'm not looking forward to next semester's lessons.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.590
If you're going to get in my way,

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:56.050
maybe I'll have you comfort me first, Amano-san!

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:00.390
Mommy!

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:01.730
S-Sensei!

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:02.100
Oh, my!
S-Sensei!

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:02.940
Oh, my!

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:06.940
Minowa-sama from the bourgeois
class—I mean, Class B!

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:10.150
May I lick your feet?

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:13.110
I don't want to become one of these dirty adults!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:17.410
Rin-chan, put on your birthday racing suit!

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.410
It's a teacher scandal!

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.080
A picture isn't enough,
take a video instead.

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:24.670
Listen, Raimu-senpai.

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:26.630
If I'm going to let you have a Bike Club,

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:29.130
you have to take care
of the members properly.

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:31.880
Don't let there be any accidents or anything.

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:34.340
I mean, if something happens
to the Bike Club members,

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:37.220
and I'm held accountable as the principal...

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:39.220
First of all, I'll kill you.

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.060
Even if you don't die, I'll kill you.

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:42.980
Whatever it takes, I'll kill you.

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:52.900
I wonder if Saruyama-sensei will
become our advisor?

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.200
Of course she will.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:55.950
We have the photo proof.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.330
Alcohol sure is scary.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:02.540
It's decided! When I become
an adult, I'll never drive drunk!

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:03.830
Of course not.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.500
You'll get tied up.

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:15.880
I guess that's the end of our Hokkaido tour.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:19.390
To think that this is
the end is kinda sad.

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:26.520
Hey, is it okay if I go and ride for a bit?

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:29.270
It's fine. We still have some time.

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:30.320
Don't rush.

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:31.980
You can never return.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:35.650
It'll be fine since Senpai's with us.

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:39.120
No, it's not that.

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:41.830
I meant that the heart doesn't return.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:47.580
Hokkaido is like a dream for any rider.

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:51.500
I still want to ride and see all kinds of places.

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:55.670
But it's time to wake up.

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:59.050
Reality is waiting for us tomorrow.

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:02.220
You can't take back the feelings of a dream
to the real world, it's too painful.

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:06.520
It sure is huge.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:10.310
Your passion for Hokkaido is
growing huge inside you.

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.730
You can tell?

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:13.820
That'll make it tough to go home.

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:17.240
Let your passion stay here.

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:20.370
You can only take souvenirs.

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:22.830
Okay.

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:35.300
Bye!

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:40.300
Shaggy, I always thought it was normal
for you to spout nonsense,

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:44.010
but that was even weirder.
How embarrassing.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:44.810
It's fine.

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:50.060
All those embarrassing things
you can't say or do in everyday life

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.440
fit Hokkaido perfectly.

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:53.980
Hmph.

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:00.950
Goodbye, Hokkaido!

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:09.790
All right, let's scrape off Hokkaido's dirt.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.710
Can I spray you all I want, Onsa-chan?

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:15.000
Yeah, of course.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.960
Take this, Rin-chan!

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:19.420
Don't point the high-pressure washer at people!

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:23.220
Aren't you going to wash your
Ducati side car, Hijiri-chan?

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:23.890
No.

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:27.350
Hayakawa always keeps it spotless.

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:32.600
You brought a lot of
supplies, Onsa-chan.

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:36.730
Unlike cars, bikes have a lot of naked parts.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:38.400
They attract dirt and rust quickly.

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:40.950
You polish each and every one.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:44.120
Polishing bikes is like...

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:47.910
"Polishing one's soul", correct?

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:52.370
I'm done.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.710
Scratches and dirt are the

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.670
medals of honor of any off-road!

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:00.880
Hayakawa! You mustn't say such things!

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:02.720
Go over there!

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:07.810
Cleaning bikes by hand is tiring...

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:10.680
and my feet are killing me.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.060
That's it!

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:24.070
What the hell are you doing?

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:27.200
I was wondering if I could save time

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:29.120
by washing it with my body like this.

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:32.040
Wow! An American Car Wash!

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:35.080
The way you care tenderly for your bike

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:37.210
with your body, softer than a sponge...

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:39.800
Your motions as you wash it so meticulously...

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:43.930
Could this be true love?

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:47.890
I didn't say that before you got to, did I?

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:49.350
Not in the least.

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:54.020
Although, Hane wins the "Loves her bike the most" prize.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:54.850
Yes.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:59.230
Hane-chan wins first prize
for loving her bike the most.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:04.700
I love my bike even more though!

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:09.950
Hey, don't overdo it.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.450
I'm not!

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:14.040
This is the least you can do
if you love your bike.

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:27.970
I'm sure you just love

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.390
your Katana 400 too much, Rin-chan.

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:32.930
There's snacks and tea in the clubroom.

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:34.810
Let's take a break.

